# Untracked working files that must not reach the public manifests.
# The pre-commit hook rebuilds sitemap/site-index from the WORKING TREE, so any
# untracked page or asset at the repo root leaks into them. Ignoring these keeps
# the files on disk while removing that hazard.
assets/reports/spcx-reverse-dcf-heatmap.png
# Orphan export artifacts: on disk, referenced by no page. Named individually
# rather than ignoring exports/ wholesale, so genuine exports can still ship.
